Z||000033||MinnGreenGT||10-04-2001||01:10 PM||||Well, I don't personally like the purple/green combo... but it would certainly stick out.  <P>Now how about a purple body w/yellow trim & accents (I'm a graphic designer- so this involves color theory).  Yellow perfectly compliments purple, and it would look awsome!  I've never seen a purple/green car, but I saw a dark green (not quite as dark as mine) with red trim- yuck!  This green/red combo doesn't compliment each other- whereas my Green/Gold combo is a great complimentary pair (like purple/yellow).  <P>As to whether or not I'd look at your car if it were purple/green... yes, but not necessarily in a posative way.  I'll try to work up a Purple/Yellow image if you want...?||||reg||1
