Z||000043||LZeitgeist||10-04-2001||03:31 PM||||Yup, I've seen the '98 Corvette Pace Car... nope, I don't like it, either.<P>And yes, Corvettes can be "riced" just like any other kind of car. Bad taste can know no limitations, financial or otherwise. <P>However, everybody likes something different, so as long as the guy paying the money is happy, I will definitely not poop on his party.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> The only reason I publically offered an opinion in this case was because it was openly requested.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I guess that makes about six cents so far... but it sounds like the original poster is well on his way to finding something he likes, so that's what's important.. my opinion in this case, is not.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
