Z||000047||86seyellow||10-04-2001||04:25 PM||||ROb,<P>I definetly like the Purple body and yellow effects. So here is the final idea-<P>Car Bright purple<BR>Gound effects Bright YEllow<BR>Door trim Brigfht YEllow<BR>Mirrors Bright Yellow<BR>Wing Bright YEllow<BR>Center cap bright yellow<BR>Pontiac words on rear bumper Yellow<BR>Pontiac words on HEad light Yellow<BR>on the bottom of front fenders and on bottom doors a small fiero emblem.<P>SO, I think we have a sharp looking ride. Now for the estimate , then the actual paint. Um, Do you think everyone will let me join in on rides and cruises still???<BR>or am I going to be known as a ricer and show trailer car??<P>||||reg||1
